#: ../../production.md:1
msgid "Production checklist"
msgstr "Orodha ya ukaguzi wa production"

#: ../../production.md:3
msgid ""
"Work through this list before you ship. Each item comes from something "
"that goes wrong in real integrations."
msgstr ""
"Pitia orodha hii kabla ya kupeleka huduma production. Kila kipengele "
"kinatokana na jambo ambalo linaweza kwenda vibaya katika integrations halisi."

#: ../../production.md:5
msgid "Before you deploy"
msgstr "Kabla ya ku-deploy"

#: ../../production.md:7
msgid ""
"Store API keys in environment variables or a secrets manager, never in "
"source code."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi API keys kwenye environment variables au secrets manager, kamwe "
"si kwenye source code."

#: ../../production.md:8
msgid ""
"Never expose a key in a browser or mobile app. Call the API from your own"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Usiwahi kuweka key wazi kwenye browser au mobile app. Ita API kutoka "
"kwenye server yako mwenyewe."

#: ../../production.md:9
msgid ""
"Set a timeout on every request. Without one, a stalled connection can "
"hang your application."
msgstr ""
"Weka timeout kwenye kila request. Bila timeout, connection iliyokwama "
"inaweza kusimamisha application yako."

#: ../../production.md:10
msgid ""
"Retry `429` and `500` responses and network failures. Do not retry other "
"`4xx` errors."
msgstr ""
"Jaribu tena responses za `429` na `500` pamoja na network failures. "
"Usijaribu tena errors nyingine za `4xx`."

#: ../../production.md:11
msgid ""
"Wait for `Retry-After` on a `429`, and use exponential backoff with a "
"little random jitter for everything else."
msgstr ""
"Subiri `Retry-After` kwenye `429`, na tumia exponential backoff pamoja "
"na random jitter kidogo kwa kila kitu kingine."

#: ../../production.md:12
msgid "Log the `request_id` of every failed request so support can find it."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi kwenye log `request_id` ya kila request iliyoshindwa ili support "
"iweze kuipata."

#: ../../production.md:13
msgid "Do not log prompts or responses. They may contain personal data."
msgstr ""
"Usihifadhi prompts au responses kwenye log. Zinaweza kuwa na data ya kibinafsi."

#: ../../production.md:14
msgid "Check `finish_reason`. A value of `length` means the response was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Angalia `finish_reason`. Thamani ya `length` inamaanisha response "
"ilikatizwa."

#: ../../production.md:15
msgid "Record `usage.total_tokens` so you can see how much each feature uses."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi `usage.total_tokens` ili uweze kuona kila feature inatumia kiasi gani."

#: ../../production.md:16
msgid ""
"Choose the `region` on purpose and confirm the `X-Data-Region` header "
"matches what you expect."
msgstr ""
"Chagua `region` kwa makusudi na uthibitishe kuwa header ya "
"`X-Data-Region` inalingana na unachotarajia."

#: ../../production.md:17
msgid ""
"Handle `model_not_found`. Do not assume a model ID will exist forever. "
"List models at startup if you can."
msgstr ""
"Shughulikia `model_not_found`. Usidhani kuwa model ID itaendelea kuwepo "
"milele. Orodhesha models wakati wa kuanza ikiwa unaweza."

#: ../../production.md:18
msgid "Monitor how long requests take, and alert when they get slower."
msgstr ""
"Fuatilia requests zinachukua muda gani, na toa alert zinapoanza kuwa polepole."

#: ../../production.md:20
msgid "A client that follows the list"
msgstr "Client inayofuata orodha"

#: ../../production.md:22
msgid ""
"The repository includes a small Python client that covers the timeout, "
"retry, backoff and logging items. This is its request method."
msgstr ""
"Repository ina Python client ndogo inayoshughulikia timeout, retry, "
"backoff na logging. Hii ndiyo request method yake."

#: ../../production.md:29
msgid "A few choices worth pointing out:"
msgstr "Baadhi ya maamuzi yanayofaa kuangaziwa:"

#: ../../production.md:31
msgid ""
"It gives up straight away if the server asks for a wait longer than "
"`max_retry_wait`. A request that blocks for a minute is usually worse "
"than a clear failure."
msgstr ""
"Inakata mara moja ikiwa server itaomba usubiri zaidi ya `max_retry_wait`. "
"Request inayokwama kwa dakika moja kwa kawaida ni mbaya zaidi kuliko "
"failure iliyo wazi."

#: ../../production.md:32
msgid ""
"It logs the status, error type and request ID. It never logs the prompt "
"or the response."
msgstr ""
"Inahifadhi status, error type na request ID kwenye log. Haihifadhi prompt "
"au response kwenye log kamwe."

#: ../../production.md:33
msgid ""
"It only retries statuses in `RETRYABLE_STATUS`. A `400` will not succeed "
"on a second attempt, so the client raises it at once."
msgstr ""
"Inajaribu tena statuses zilizo kwenye `RETRYABLE_STATUS` pekee. `400` "
"haitafanikiwa kwenye jaribio la pili, kwa hiyo client inatoa error hiyo "
"mara moja."